{"id":"wb-7-1108","name":"紫阳堤","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"紫阳堤","text":"紫阳堤位于中国江西省庐山市（原星子县）紫阳南路南端，鄱阳湖西岸，2013年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n北宋太平兴国三年（公元978年），星子镇升为县，四年后又设南康军。南宋淳熙六年(1179年)，朱熹知南康军，任内将旧堤扩建。后人以朱熹别号称之为紫阳堤。紫阳堤以石条叠砌而成，堤宽七八米，长一公里左右，向外微微凸出，略呈弧形。岸与堤之间有石桥连接，桥下有拱洞供渔舟出入，堤内面积共2800平方米。这是中国最早、最大的港口石堤。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B4%AB%E9%98%B3%E5%A0%A4","revisionId":86555377,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555377","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/29c13c80168903debda16e8d.jpg","title":"Xingzi_Ziyang_Di_2018.06.09_19-01-47.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xingzi_Ziyang_Di_2018.06.09_19-01-47.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/Xingzi_Ziyang_Di_2018.06.09_19-01-47.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"紫阳堤","width":320,"height":240}}